</head><body><div id="root"><main class="cq-seo-snapshot max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8" data-cq-seo-snapshot="true"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">CanQuery</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Developer account</span></li></ol></nav><article><h1>Developer account</h1><p>Sign in to manage API keys, usage and billing. JavaScript is required for account actions.</p><section><h2>Explore CanQuery</h2><ul><li><a href="/login">Sign in</a></li></ul></section></article></main></div></body></html>",
